+	/// <summary>
+	/// Optimum (Vulkan-native render systems, Phase 3b decision 5 stage 2): the texture-into-texture
+	/// blit's draw, as a seam of its own.
+	///
+	/// What it draws: the unit quad ClientMain.RenderTextureIntoFrameBuffer stretches a rectangle of
+	/// one texture over a rectangle of another with - the draw that bakes every Cairo-drawn GUI and
